22
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:45,039
We must remember that before the eighteenth century, agriculture in the Old World

23
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:51,600
struggled a lot, the land yielded little, and there were very strict limits. And yet,

24
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:56,920
the records show that between the year 1000 and the year 1900, the global population more

25
