84
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:59,120
A whole quarter of the global demographic development of two centuries

85
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:03,759
is solely thanks to this single, incredible agricultural innovation.

86
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:08,120
Let's conclude with section 5: the legacy of the tuber.

87
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:12,439
The impact of this agricultural shock went far beyond simple demographics,

88
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:14,319
